  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On live build you would be able to click on someone whose avatar is hidden due to download size limit etc., and click avatar stats to check how big the avatar they're wearing is (not the fallback avatar's download size).\nOn beta, this is not the case as I can only see the fallback avatar's download size instead of the actual avatar. This is annoying if a friend of my friend has an avatar that is too big as I have accidentally allowed a 200MB avatar to be shown, trusting in my friend's friend's avatar to only be 5 or 10 MB off my limit.",
